# name: Amazing Grace
# category: Traditional American
# tempo: 72

# Amazing grace, how sweet the sound
g3 c4*2 e/2 c/2 e*2 d
c*2 a3 g*2 r
# That saved a wretch like me
g c4*2 e/2 c/2 e*2 d
g*3 r
# I once was lost but now am found
g e*2 g/2 e/2 g*2 e
c*2 a3 g*2 r
# Was blind but now I see
g c4*2 e/2 c/2 e*2 d
c*3
